    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5336" root="جذف" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْذَافٌ</span></b> , (S, TA,) in the K ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْذَافَةٌ</span></b> , but the
former is the more proper, (TA,) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِجْدَافٌ</span>;
(S;) The <i>wing</i> of a bird: and so with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span>. (Msb
in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جدف</span>.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And [hence, <i>An oar; a paddle;</i>]
<i>a certain thing with which a ship,</i> or <i>boat, is
propelled.</i> (S, * TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And hence, as being
likened thereto, <i>A whip:</i> (Abu-l-Ghowth, S:)
and so with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">د</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جدف</span>.)

